# M16: a folder with more than the dialog lists. 2,100 files and a folder: the list stops at 2,000 entries, says so, and still scrolls and
# types ahead across its two pages.
@dialog
@cwd C:\BIG
@dir BIG\SUB
@many BIG 2100 QLD
f10 down enter                # File > Open...
tab tab tab tab tab tab tab   # to the list
pagedown pagedown pagedown
end
pageup
home
f 0 9 9 9
alt2
alt2
end
esc
